The source of this skill, the Applied AI page "86 Claude Animation Styles and How to Make Them" (https://www.its-applied-ai.com/r/styles) by Applied AI, states no license.

This skill uses only the list of style names and ideas from that page. All prompts, recipes, example clips and posters in this folder are written and rendered by Subclip in our own words. Nothing from the page is copied verbatim.

Because the source states no license, treat the license of this adaptation as "Not stated". Creator permission has not been confirmed and the Subclip maintainers need to confirm it with the creator. Contact the maintainers to request changes or removal at any time.

Upstream repositories named in the prompt files keep their own licenses: mrdoob/three.js (MIT), heygen-com/hyperframes (Apache-2.0). joeseesun/opus-video-prompts states no license and nothing from it is copied.
